# The runner is built with the repository root as its context, because the two
# files it needs live there, and BuildKit reads this file — named after the
# Dockerfile beside it — instead of the root .dockerignore, which is the
# release image's. Everything else is excluded: the source is mounted at run
# time, never copied, and sending the host .venv to the builder would cost
# gigabytes for nothing.
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
